---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kreuzfeuer | Ray Weiss"
  description="Kreuzfeuer. A Reformation-era roguelike CRPG of the Holy Roman Empire. Early access on itch under Conflict Simulations LLC."
>
  <main class="doc">
    <div class="doc__frame">
      <header class="page-heading">
        <nav class="eyebrow" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/conflict-simulations-llc"
            >Conflict Simulations LLC</a
          >
        </nav>
        <h1>Kreuzfeuer</h1>
        <p class="dek">A Reformation-era roguelike CRPG of the Holy Roman Empire. Early access.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose-body">
        <p>
          The year is 1524, and the Empire is burning at its edges. You lead a party of pilgrims,
          mercenaries, scholars and heretics across a procedurally generated Holy Roman Empire in
          the years the old order cracked. Illustrated with the woodcuts of D&uuml;rer.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every run generates a new Empire: a hundred-odd towns, monasteries, shrines, ruins and
          camps along the roads, five factions contesting them, and a calendar of real history that
          advances whether you attend to it or not. Life-path character creation; turn-based
          tactical combat with initiative, flanking, morale and gear that wears down.
        </p>
        <p>
          Contracts, pamphlet printing, a stronghold, tavern dice, wanted levels, witch trials.
          Permadeath with a chronicle: every run ends as a broadsheet account of what the company
          did and what it cost. Skills grow by use.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure>
        <img
          src="/images/games/kreuzfeuer-cover.png"
          alt="Kreuzfeuer cover: woodcut of three horsemen with scales, sword and bow above blackletter title and the years MDXXIV to MDXXXV"
          width="800"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>Title card</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="prose-body terminal-section">
        <h2>Buy</h2>
        <p>
          Early access on itch under Conflict Simulations LLC at $9.99. Windows, macOS. Ships with A
          Wanderer's Companion, the full manual.
          <a href="https://conflict-simulations-llc.itch.io/kreuzfeuer"
            >conflict-simulations-llc.itch.io/kreuzfeuer</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
